资产组合可能遭受的最大潜在损失。 20.预期尾部损失(ES)：超过特定置信区间下风险价值的全部潜在损失的平均值。", "score": 0.9286486486486487, "rerank_score": 0.8786486486486487, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "mcq_exact_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop", "exact_support_score": 0.9545}}, {"document_id": "DOC-20260717-F30D7E400A8C", "chunk_id": "DOC-20260717-F30D7E400A8C-CHUNK-0014", "filename": "409_商业银行资本管理办法_附件13：账簿划分和名词解释.docx", "section_title": "一、交易账簿的范围及划分的标准", "page_number": null, "excerpt": "可分拆嵌入衍生工具是指嵌入到非衍生工具（即主合同）中的衍生工具，且其可从混合合同中分拆并在资产负债表中单独确认。 6.符合下列标准之一的资产管理产品：", "score": 0.9286486486486487, "rerank_score": 0.8286486486486486, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "mcq_rule_preamble", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop"}}]}
