替换。 2．或者，行使赎回权后的资本水平仍明显高于国家金融监督管理总局规定的监管资本要求。", "score": 0.93, "rerank_score": 0.88, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "mcq_exact_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop", "exact_support_score": 0.9706}}]}
```

